check 1
# Save channel (scenario-diff.md §3 rule 13): a fresh expansion Amazon,
# 20 idle ticks in the Rogue Encampment, then Save and Exit (C->S 0x69
# before frame 21's tick on both sides). Compares the written .d2s byte
# for byte (save time +0x30 and the checksum normalised).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md, specs/formats/d2s.md.
name save-fresh-ama
save SavAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 20
seconds 240
channels save
